<title>SWEDEN: Sweden sets auction of 6.5 bln skr T-bills.</title>
<headline>Sweden sets auction of 6.5 bln skr T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's National Debt Office said on Wednesday it would invite bids from the market for an auction of Treasury bills worth 6.5 billion crowns.</p>
<p>The auction will take place on April 16, it said and bids are due by 1030 GMT on the same day.</p>
<p>Settlement date is April 18.</p>
